 "captions": [
  {
   "text": "Grandpa, I press Enter and",
   "s": 0,
   "e": 1.14,
   "line": 1,
   "sp": "B"
  },
  {
   "text": "the page is there in",
   "s": 1.2,
   "e": 1.94,
   "line": 1,
   "sp": "B"
  },
  {
   "text": "half a second.",
   "s": 2,
   "e": 2.84,
   "line": 1,
   "sp": "B"
  },
  {
   "text": "What happened?",
   "s": 2.9,
   "e": 3.71,
   "line": 1,
   "sp": "B"
  },
  {
   "text": "First, the computer asks",
   "s": 4,
   "e": 5.24,
   "line": 2,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "where that name lives.",
   "s": 5.3,
   "e": 6.68,
   "line": 2,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "It has no idea.",
   "s": 6.74,
   "e": 8.17,
   "line": 2,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "Asks who?",
   "s": 8.48,
   "e": 9.4,
   "line": 3,
   "sp": "B"
  },
  {
   "text": "A phone book for the internet.",
   "s": 9.46,
   "e": 10.95,
   "line": 4,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "Name in,",
   "s": 11.16,
   "e": 11.88,
   "line": 4,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "number out.",
   "s": 11.94,
   "e": 12.89,
   "line": 4,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "It's called DNS.",
   "s": 13.04,
   "e": 14.33,
   "line": 4,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "What kind of number?",
   "s": 14.66,
   "e": 15.82,
   "line": 5,
   "sp": "B"
  },
  {
   "text": "An address,",
   "s": 15.88,
   "e": 16.6,
   "line": 6,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "like a street.",
   "s": 16.66,
   "e": 17.55,
   "line": 6,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "Now it knows which",
   "s": 17.76,
   "e": 18.66,
   "line": 6,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "machine to call.",
   "s": 18.72,
   "e": 19.91,
   "line": 6,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "So it starts talking?",
   "s": 20,
   "e": 21.15,
   "line": 7,
   "sp": "B"
  },
  {
   "text": "First, a handshake.",
   "s": 21.38,
   "e": 22.89,
   "line": 8,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "Hello. Hello back.",
   "s": 23.04,
   "e": 24.43,
   "line": 8,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "Okay, go.",
   "s": 24.62,
   "e": 25.83,
   "line": 8,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "Three tiny messages.",
   "s": 25.98,
   "e": 27.41,
   "line": 8,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "Hello? To a computer?",
   "s": 27.78,
   "e": 29.31,
   "line": 9,
   "sp": "B"
  },
  {
   "text": "Computers are polite.",
   "s": 29.56,
   "e": 31.03,
   "line": 10,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "And the little padlock?",
   "s": 31.18,
   "e": 32.63,
   "line": 11,
   "sp": "B"
  },
  {
   "text": "Then they agree on",
   "s": 32.86,
   "e": 33.54,
   "line": 12,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "a secret code,",
   "s": 33.6,
   "e": 34.36,
   "line": 12,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "out in the open.",
   "s": 34.42,
   "e": 35.55,
   "line": 12,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "The padlock means it worked.",
   "s": 35.8,
   "e": 37.61,
   "line": 12,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "Wait. I haven't even asked",
   "s": 37.76,
   "e": 38.98,
   "line": 13,
   "sp": "B"
  },
  {
   "text": "for the page yet?",
   "s": 39.04,
   "e": 40.11,
   "line": 13,
   "sp": "B"
  },
  {
   "text": "Now you ask.",
   "s": 40.3,
   "e": 41.28,
   "line": 14,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "One line: give me this page.",
   "s": 41.34,
   "e": 43.69,
   "line": 14,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "Back comes the skeleton,",
   "s": 43.92,
   "e": 44.86,
   "line": 14,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "called HTML.",
   "s": 44.92,
   "e": 46.33,
   "line": 14,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "Just a skeleton?",
   "s": 46.68,
   "e": 47.99,
   "line": 15,
   "sp": "B"
  },
  {
   "text": "It lists pictures,",
   "s": 48.1,
   "e": 49.24,
   "line": 16,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "styles, scripts.",
   "s": 49.3,
   "e": 50.57,
   "line": 16,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "The browser fetches each one,",
   "s": 50.82,
   "e": 52.42,
   "line": 16,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "then paints the page.",
   "s": 52.48,
   "e": 53.95,
   "line": 16,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "All of that in",
   "s": 54.1,
   "e": 54.76,
   "line": 17,
   "sp": "B"
  },
  {
   "text": "half a second?",
   "s": 54.82,
   "e": 55.89,
   "line": 17,
   "sp": "B"
  },
  {
   "text": "Usually less.",
   "s": 55.96,
   "e": 57.09,
   "line": 18,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "Then why does my news",
   "s": 57.16,
   "e": 58.2,
   "line": 19,
   "sp": "B"
  },
  {
   "text": "site take five seconds?",
   "s": 58.26,
   "e": 59.93,
   "line": 19,
   "sp": "B"
  },
  {
   "text": "The page arrived in",
   "s": 60.64,
   "e": 61.6,
   "line": 20,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "half a second.",
   "s": 61.66,
   "e": 62.59,
   "line": 20,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "The ads are still shaking hands.",
   "s": 62.8,
   "e": 64.59,
   "line": 20,
   "sp": "A"
  }
 ],
